  <data key="d0">likelihood_L</data>
  <data key="d1">Concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The likelihood function L maps parameter vectors in Θ^n to real numbers and is maximized to estimate parameters.</data>
  <data key="d3">mitra.pdf p.10 page_text chunk_895bf8c81d74ac37</data>
  <data key="d4">10</data>
